  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2015 개정교육과정</p><p>중1 생물의 다양성</p><p>&#160;</p><p>교과서 본문자료입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997728345ACC9C7835\" data-file-name=\"교과서본문자료_3_1단원.pdf\" data-file-size=\"3599171\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D2%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20180410201548&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcfile%2Fcafe%2F997728345ACC9C7835')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">교과서본문자료_3_1단원</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.43MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992E36345ACC9C780F\" data-file-name=\"교과서본문자료_3_2단원.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2086913\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D2%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20180410201548&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcfile%2Fcafe%2F992E36345ACC9C780F')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">교과서본문자료_3_2단원</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.99MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55dc53bbe439a6cdca7fc6f40c6fc32ce992db87?download\" data-file-name=\"지도서본문자료_3_2단원.pdf\" data-file-size=\"3066848\"